# No Product Manager agent

- There is **no** Product Manager / PM agent pack in this plugin.
- Product owner is the **human**: brief, priorities, accept/reject, business escalations.
- “PM/human” in role docs means the human product owner (with coordinator routing), not an agent role.
- Missing or conflicting product intent → escalate to the human; agents must not invent product priorities.
